WEBVTT

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.370
<b>Chio's</b>

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:21.370
School Road

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:35.690
<b>Chio-chan Changes Her Image</b>

00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:34.570
Even in high school, you're still 
cramming the night before the test?

00:01:35.690 --> 00:01:37.950
This is a valid strategy for test-taking.

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:39.860
Here. Have a midnight snack.

00:01:40.550 --> 00:01:42.030
Well, do your best.

00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:47.480
<i>It's just memorization of liberal arts stuff.</i>

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:51.290
<i>If I work real hard tonight, I should be 
able to secure a below-average score.</i>

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:58.570
<i>Wait... how do you write the second 
kanji in "authority" again?</i>

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:05.300
That's the last thing I remember.

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:08.540
Before I knew it, I was 
having a shootout online.

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:10.630
Then I suddenly got shot and yelped...

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:13.520
After that, my mom came in, 
and we got into an argument...

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:15.990
Then I got pissed off, 
so I went to bed sulking!

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:17.490
<i>Wow...</i>

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:21.240
So does that mean you haven't 
studied for today's test at all?

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:21.820
Pretty much.

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:23.130
But...

00:02:23.130 --> 00:02:25.280
I have my ultimate last resort strategy.

00:02:25.280 --> 00:02:29.130
Strategy? Don't tell me you're 
going to pray to God or something.

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:30.900
Please, God, I implore you!

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:32.460
Offerings

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:35.380
Please, God, I beg of you!

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.340
Okay, that should do it!

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:43.300
I mean, I even offered a hundred yen!

00:02:43.460 --> 00:02:45.840
Now I shouldn't have any 
problems with my test!

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:48.330
In fact, my whole life will be at peace!

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:49.980
Jeez, you're optimistic.

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:52.400
There's no way a selfish 
wish like that would—

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:53.770
<b>Offerings</b>

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:53.770
Your wish...

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:56.320
<b>Offerings</b>

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:56.060
has been granted!

00:02:56.520 --> 00:02:57.840
Wh-Who's there?!

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.820
It's me! The Great Avatar!

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:05.330
You're...

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:08.370
...the guy who was with Kushitori-senpai 
at the park... the master!

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:10.210
It's been a while.

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:12.250
<i>What the hell is he even doing here?</i>

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:13.260
Miyamo.

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:14.990
<i>Hey, he remembered my name.</i>

00:03:14.990 --> 00:03:17.670
You seemed to be troubled about your test.

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:22.660
I never forget the name of a high 
school girl once I've heard it...

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:24.850
Never!

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:26.390
So, uh, what do you want?

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:30.900
I thought I'd give you a word of advice.

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:34.770
Despite how I look, I was 
once considered an elite.

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:37.570
I am a winner when it comes 
to the academic world.

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:41.650
<i>Oh, yeah. He did mention that he 
was a successful salaryman before...</i>

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:40.730
I know how the world works.

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:45.480
You don't even need to try 
that hard in your studies.

00:03:45.480 --> 00:03:46.730
What? Really?

00:03:46.730 --> 00:03:48.040
Listen well...

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:51.420
Girls should be concentrating more 
on how to improve their looks

00:03:51.420 --> 00:03:53.750
than on their academic scores!

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.710
<i>He actually said it!</i>

00:03:55.710 --> 00:04:00.200
Listen, I saw it countless times 
while I worked at the trading firm.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:02.880
When it came to hiring women,

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:07.140
they would hire based solely on their 
looks, and not their academic history.

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:09.220
And so, Miyamo...

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:12.270
I shall remake you!

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:14.930
Let's make you street smart!

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:20.270
I mean... I know there might be 
some advantages to being pretty,

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:23.670
but you've got to be somewhat 
decent to begin with.

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:26.430
And when unattractive girls try too hard,

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:30.290
they get targeted and end up getting hurt.

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:33.080
A girl as below average as me wouldn't...

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:34.210
Not to worry.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:39.110
You are beautiful, my dear.

00:04:39.110 --> 00:04:42.000
You are without a doubt 
a diamond in the rough,

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:44.970
and I want you to let me polish you.

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:45.710
Huh?

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:47.510
Manana...

00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:52.640
You never realized it?

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:55.100
I've thought that this whole time!

00:04:56.390 --> 00:04:57.520
I'll do it!

00:04:58.150 --> 00:05:00.440
<i>This is getting interesting!</i>

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:02.860
<b>Chio-chan's</b>

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:02.860
<b>Beautification Project</b>

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:02.860
<b>Begins</b>

00:05:04.770 --> 00:05:07.940
Now you will also enjoy life in easy mode!

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:09.530
I'm counting on you, sir!

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:11.360
I need your help, young one.

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:12.450
Uh, sure...

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:15.330
But where did you get those wigs and props?

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:20.000
Well, you see, underneath this shrine 
is where I store all the things I find.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.820
<i>Blasphemy!</i>

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:26.180
All right, how about we take a 
look at your natural face, Miyamo?

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:28.240
Could you take your glasses off?

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:29.680
Oh, sure...

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:33.770
<i>Her face is so dull!</i>

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:37.960
<i>To be honest, I started this just for fun,</i>

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:40.360
<i>but this is going to be 
harder than I thought.</i>

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:44.330
How do I put this... 
Your face is really plain.

00:05:44.330 --> 00:05:48.490
Jeez. Your whole personality 
basically relies on your glasses.

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:53.580
But her glasses add to her 
gloominess, so we'll keep them off.

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:53.580
<i>You're saying something different now...</i>

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:56.620
First, we've got to do something 
about your lame hairstyle,

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:59.540
so we'll try this long-haired 
wig and see how it goes.

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:04.670
Now she's just some online game invalid 
who's been shut in for three years!

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:08.460
The long hair makes you look like 
M-Monsieur Kamayatsu. It suits you.

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:11.010
Oh, really? Who's that?

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:11.010
<i>Th-That wig is way too bleached!</i>

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:12.850
Let's hurry up and get this styled!

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:15.060
Ooh, that's a nice sound.

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:17.690
<i>Look at those movements! He's so experienced!</i>

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:20.310
<i>This old man is definitely not normal.</i>

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:25.230
<i>She just stepped out of the Showa era!</i>

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:28.250
<i>But wait... The usually 
conservative Chio-chan</i>

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:27.830
This is the Monroe hairstyle.

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:30.760
Wow... What's a Monroe?

00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:31.120
<i>is actually positively trying 
to change her image...</i>

00:06:31.310 --> 00:06:33.460
I'll leave her makeup to you.

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:33.990
All right...

00:06:34.650 --> 00:06:37.580
<i>I'll use all of my power</i>

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:40.080
<i>to guide you toward becoming a popular kid!</i>

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:52.930
Mana Mana Mana Mana Mana 
Mana Mana Mana Mana...

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:48.550
L-Look at her go!

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:52.930
<i>My goal... is to do the huge eyes 
makeup that's so in right now!</i>

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:57.460
Scary!

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:01.280
I gave it my all.

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:02.690
R-Right...

00:07:02.690 --> 00:07:04.540
Hey, so how do I look?

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:06.070
<i>Yikes! She talked!</i>

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:16.950
<i>What a total failure...</i>

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:19.180
What the hell's with that weird hairstyle?!

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:22.860
I never thought her face would look 
that plain without the glasses!

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:25.120
That's why I thought I'd at least 
make her hair look fancy!

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:28.710
And what do we do about the fact that she's 
so excited to look in a mirror right now?!

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:31.050
Also, what the hell is with that makeup?!

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:34.810
I couldn't help it, okay? The more I 
experimented, the more fun it became!

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:37.890
What?! So this was premeditated? 
How can you call yourself her friend?

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:40.140
Hey, hey! Are you guys done talking?

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:45.210
A-Anyway, we need to figure out what 
to do with that sad little monster...

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:46.940
R-Right...

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:48.630
What should we do? Start over?

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:51.110
We definitely don't have that much time.

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:55.360
I knew something was off as soon 
as I put the blonde wig on her.

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:57.790
Oh, actually, so did I.

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:01.790
The thing with Chio-chan is... 
her face is dated.

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:06.130
So whenever I do her makeup, 
I always go overboard.

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:07.110
What should we do?

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:09.990
Should we just stick that horse mask 
on her head and make a run for it?

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:12.510
Uh, I'll end up seeing her at school.

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:16.580
Th-This should...

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:20.600
You're right! With her 
dull face, that should...

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:23.230
Chio-chan! Forget everything we just did!

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:24.980
And if we just stick this on—

00:08:28.080 --> 00:08:29.400
<i>Indeed.</i>

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:31.190
It looks so good!

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:35.030
W-We finally found it! 
The hairstyle that fits you best!

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:38.990
I-It's absolutely perfect! 
Why hadn't I realized it before?!

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:42.300
What? That good? So my image 
has successfully been changed?

00:08:42.300 --> 00:08:43.980
Heck, yes!

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:45.220
I don't look weird at all?

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:47.350
You bet your ass you do!

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:51.670
D-Do I look a little sexy, too?

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:52.370
Oh, w-well...

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:56.090
Do you think guys will like me?

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:56.090
<i>Crap... That was the whole point...</i>

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:58.330
Uh... Um...

00:08:58.330 --> 00:08:59.390
Well, to be honest...

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:02.560
You could be in a dirty mag!

00:09:02.560 --> 00:09:04.940
I've ascended to that level?

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:06.620
Hey, why'd you put it like that?

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:10.110
Well, the pretty ladies in the old Japanese 
paintings basically looked like that.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:12.530
<i>Still, I mean...</i>

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:15.780
I see... So I look that different 
just by changing my hairstyle...

00:09:12.710 --> 00:09:16.380
<i>That hair doesn't go with her uniform at all!</i>

00:09:16.940 --> 00:09:19.620
Actually, I guess that happens 
all the time in stories.

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:21.740
Hey, you two.

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:23.830
Smooch. Thank you.

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:31.090
As of today, I'm finally graduating 
from being below average...

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:36.510
I guess I'll start stealing 
boys' hearts, one after another.

00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:38.930
Say, you two...

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:44.220
Do you want to see the new, 
reborn, sexy Chio-chan?

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:56.870
<i>Just a little bit...</i>

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:13.850
<i>Fujiyama tempura!</i>

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:16.260
<i>Oh, behave.</i>

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:18.680
<i>All right!</i>

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:21.090
<i>Your mother's topknot.</i>

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:34.610
Well? How was that absolutely 
sexy pole dancing?

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:35.450
<i>Shit...</i>

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:36.610
<i>What should we do?</i>

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:39.070
Was it worthy of the new Chio-chan...

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:45.080
Hey, this is my usual hairstyle.

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:46.110
Manana?

00:10:46.490 --> 00:10:47.280
Yeah!

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:51.480
So, actually, um, uh... Y-Y-Yeah!

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:53.000
Uh, so basically...

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:56.720
Chio-chan, when you're 
your below average self,

00:10:56.720 --> 00:11:00.650
you're the most precious and most beautiful...

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:04.170
Huh? Wait, so what was all that 
about being in a dirty mag?

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:07.360
Well, I just meant that if you 
weren't popular to everyone,

00:11:07.360 --> 00:11:11.100
there'd still be a need for you somewhere.

00:11:12.010 --> 00:11:16.030
I see! I get it.

00:11:16.660 --> 00:11:18.490
This was all a waste of time!

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:19.920
I'm going to school!

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:21.360
Hey, wait!

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:23.430
If I fail, it's both of your faults!

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:24.490
See you again!

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:28.570
How fun. I got to play with high school 
girls again first thing in the morning.

00:11:29.240 --> 00:11:30.660
But you know...

00:11:30.850 --> 00:11:33.580
There's just one thing I 
want you to remember...

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:38.970
The only ones who are able to play with wigs

00:11:38.970 --> 00:11:42.470
are those blessed enough 
to not truly need them.

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:45.470
<i>Chio's—</i>God, I beseech you!<i>—School R—</i>

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:45.470
<b>Chio's</b>

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:45.470
School Road

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:48.850
When the hell did you 
learn how to pole dance?

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:52.850
Well, there was this pervy bar 
in some game I was playing,

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:56.270
and I ended up watching it all day 
one day because I was bored...

00:11:56.670 --> 00:11:58.560
And I just picked it up it naturally.

00:11:58.560 --> 00:12:01.500
<i>So her life as a girl is basically over.</i>

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:13.500
<b>Flat Cut</b>

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:10.500
Man...

00:12:11.070 --> 00:12:14.170
Aren't these water pipes that 
are placed above rivers great?

00:12:16.510 --> 00:12:17.500
I'm sorry, how?

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:21.670
This fence... The slippery surface.

00:12:21.890 --> 00:12:25.750
They definitely made it difficult for 
anyone who wants to try to walk across.

00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:27.620
Uh, yeah. You're not supposed to walk on it.

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:29.280
But right in the middle is a resting point.

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:31.390
Uh, that's not a resting point.

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:33.470
It's sort of like a man 
who's strong and strict,

00:12:33.470 --> 00:12:37.270
but still has some kindness in him... Right?

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:38.680
Chio-chan...

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:41.360
No, I don't get it!

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:44.030
And the fact that you anthropomorphized 
a bridge makes you sound like a fujoshi—

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:46.060
Who are you calling a fujoshi, damn it?!

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:46.490
Whoa, you flipped!

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:50.580
I mean, I found a BL game magazine in your room!

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:51.040
Huh?!

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:54.780
There seems to be something under here...

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:00.370
Th-That's just... I just 
accidentally bought it...

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:02.920
I only look at it every once in a while...

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:07.850
Let's forget about that! I want to talk 
about how cool that water pipe looks!

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:10.790
And I'm telling you that normal 
girls wouldn't care about that!

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:11.890
What?!

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:14.620
But it looks so cool!

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:16.790
Let's get married!

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:19.520
<b>Let's get
married!!</b>

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:19.520
If someone p-p-proposed to me up there, 
I'd probably say yes without thinking.

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:23.750
You don't even have a boyfriend!

00:13:23.750 --> 00:13:24.970
You seriously just said propfbt—

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:27.110
Shut up! Who cares?!

00:13:28.020 --> 00:13:30.080
Jeez!

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:32.270
Man, that was hilarious.

00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:35.830
I seriously have no idea 
what your basis for "cool" is.

00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:39.520
At this rate, you'll never find a...

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:40.210
Isn't that...

00:13:43.970 --> 00:13:46.310
Huh? Andou-san?

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:47.380
A newspaper?

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:48.800
<b>Saitou</b>

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:54.850
Andou-style newspaper delivery technique...

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:56.270
Heaven Destroyer!

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:01.940
A-Amazing!

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:05.410
Oh, hey! I didn't see you guys there!

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:06.320
What?

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:10.520
I guess you saw me really getting into it.

00:14:10.520 --> 00:14:13.490
That was my last one, so I 
got a little too excited.

00:14:13.490 --> 00:14:16.790
<i>Wait, he was totally showing off, right?</i>

00:14:17.650 --> 00:14:21.210
Th-That was amazing! What was that?!

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:20.580
Chio-chan?!

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:22.130
It's nothing...

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:25.340
<i>Chio-chan... She's showing 
so much interest in this.</i>

00:14:25.870 --> 00:14:30.220
<i>If this is what Andou-san was 
after, that would mean...</i>

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:28.740
That's amazing!

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:33.560
<i>Andou-san likes Chio-chan, right?</i>

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:31.620
Like this?

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:33.050
More of a whip motion.

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:33.570
Yeah.

00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:34.520
See ya.

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:36.600
<i>Huh?</i>

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:41.290
<i>He seemed to leave pretty quickly.</i>

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:45.270
<i>Huh? Did I have the wrong idea?</i>

00:14:45.270 --> 00:14:46.690
<i>Maybe he just genuinely...</i>

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:50.280
<i>Huh?</i>

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:54.780
Now that that's done, 
I guess I'll have a smoke.

00:14:55.810 --> 00:14:58.460
Oh, right. I forgot I quit.

00:14:58.930 --> 00:15:01.130
<i>He's not actually talking to himself, is he?</i>

00:15:01.610 --> 00:15:03.610
I'll have a cigar instead.

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:06.630
<i>He just leveled up!</i>

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:18.950
<i>I mean, it suits him, but...</i>

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:22.440
Oh, hey, Miyamo.

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:23.150
Is that one of those cigar things?!

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:23.990
Yeah, it is.

00:15:23.990 --> 00:15:25.230
I've never seen one before!

00:15:25.390 --> 00:15:27.180
<i>Now I know for sure...</i>

00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:28.190
Wow! A real cigar!

00:15:27.180 --> 00:15:31.540
<i>Everything Andou-san does 
is to appeal to Chio-chan!</i>

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:35.120
<i>Which means Andou-san likes Chio-chan!</i>

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:38.220
<i>And somehow, Andou-san's slightly-off 
way of seeming appealing</i>

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:41.120
<i>is a home run with Chio-chan!</i>

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:43.630
<i>They might actually end 
up a couple at this rate!</i>

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:48.420
<i>I don't think Chio-chan has a clue, 
but seriously, what kind of pairing is this?</i>

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:54.260
<i>I always figured Chio-chan would go out 
with a guy who'd be depicted like this...</i>

00:15:54.810 --> 00:15:57.200
<i>Andou-san probably doesn't have 
much of an academic record,</i>

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:58.720
<i>but what's scary about his type is...</i>

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:01.170
<i>They totally turn their lives around!</i>

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:04.580
<i>A former delinquent uses 
his personality and actions</i>

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:07.690
<i>to go out into society and 
somehow makes it super big...</i>

00:16:07.690 --> 00:16:10.860
<i>There are plenty of stories like that.</i>

00:16:07.870 --> 00:16:09.460
Get yer ass out here!

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:14.360
Supermarket Sashisu

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:14.780
<i>Imagine the impending future...</i>

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:18.120
Ugh... Veggies went up in price again.

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:20.370
Also, the water's really 
heavy when I buy it here.

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:22.960
If I could afford even a small car...

00:16:24.470 --> 00:16:25.590
<i>A convertible?</i>

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:28.630
<i>Really? On a chilly day like this? Wait...</i>

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:29.810
Chio-chan?!

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:31.840
Oh, hey, Manana!

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:34.050
You bought another new car?

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:35.580
Yeah, we did!

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:39.410
My honey insisted on getting 
a convertible, and...

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:41.640
Well, I'm not very smart.

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:44.690
But I got this lovely coat in return, so...

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:47.390
Are you riding your bike because 
you're worried about your health?

00:16:48.160 --> 00:16:49.230
Y-Yeah, something like that.

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:50.950
Good for you!

00:16:50.950 --> 00:16:53.180
If you ever buy a car, you should 
totally get a foreign one!

00:16:53.180 --> 00:16:55.610
Though they tend to be more expensive 
because of the exchange rate.

00:16:53.710 --> 00:16:55.610
I see...

00:16:55.870 --> 00:16:58.660
But once you get used to having the 
steering wheel on the left side,

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.780
these parking lots become a pain!

00:17:01.070 --> 00:17:02.100
Really?

00:17:01.490 --> 00:17:05.070
The parking ticket machines 
are always on the right side!

00:17:05.070 --> 00:17:08.240
At least supermarkets in the city
have ticketing machines on both sides!

00:17:08.240 --> 00:17:09.750
I see!

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:14.080
<i>Glare.</i>

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:22.510
Hey... What the hell was that?

00:17:23.250 --> 00:17:25.430
You had a lot of bugs on your clothes.

00:17:25.430 --> 00:17:26.690
Well, don't crush them!

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:29.100
Why?! How could you?!

00:17:26.840 --> 00:17:29.100
<i>Think... Think, damn it!</i>

00:17:29.100 --> 00:17:30.820
<i>And figure something out...</i>

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:34.320
<i>to ensure Chio-chan's below 
average and happy future...</i>

00:17:34.980 --> 00:17:38.030
<i>I'm pretty sure Andou-san will 
try something again up ahead.</i>

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:40.310
<i>Something Andou-san would do...</i>

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:43.210
Hey, girls. Why don't we get some tea?

00:17:42.650 --> 00:17:44.050
The one with black hair is cute.

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:44.990
The one with the pigtails is totally my type.

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:45.620
<i>He'd probably ask his friends to surround us.</i>

00:17:44.050 --> 00:17:45.620
I'd go for the one on the right.

00:17:45.810 --> 00:17:46.830
<i>And then...</i>

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:49.420
Are you all right, Miyamo?!

00:17:48.850 --> 00:17:49.840
I love you!

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:53.420
<i>Nah, he wouldn't actually 
do anything like that...</i>

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:56.640
You like that?

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:58.470
You don't need to rush.

00:17:59.420 --> 00:18:00.350
<i>This dude...</i>

00:18:00.940 --> 00:18:02.810
<i>might actually be just an idiot.</i>

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:06.030
<i>I think what he wanted to do was this,</i>

00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:10.190
<i>but you can tell this was all a 
setup because of that umbrella...</i>

00:18:10.780 --> 00:18:12.280
<i>What's Chio-chan's reaction?!</i>

00:18:12.860 --> 00:18:16.320
H-Huh? That cat's... George?!

00:18:16.470 --> 00:18:18.490
Andou-san! That cat!

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:20.170
Oh, this is...

00:18:24.440 --> 00:18:25.540
Um...

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:27.510
Okay, time for my next plan!

00:18:27.510 --> 00:18:29.750
<i>What? Did he actually say that out loud?!</i>

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:34.380
<i>I'm starting to feel like it'll 
be okay, even if I leave it alone.</i>

00:18:36.560 --> 00:18:41.640
Could it be that Andou-san... 
actually likes me?

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:44.800
Huh, what?! Why?!

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:48.100
Well, he messages me every once in a while...

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:48.100
It's hot today. I think ice cream would taste
really good on a day like this.
That farm-fresh kind is really good.

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:50.670
<i>Huh? When did they 
exchange email addresses?!</i>

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:55.210
<i>Wait... Are they already that 
close without my knowing?</i>

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:56.860
M-Manana?

00:18:55.520 --> 00:18:56.860
<i>Oh, I see.</i>

00:18:56.860 --> 00:19:01.780
<i>Chio-chan might seriously leave me 
in the dust on this school road.</i>

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:03.370
<i>A shadow?!</i>

00:19:03.820 --> 00:19:07.010
<i>That's probably Andou-san. 
What's he going to do now?</i>

00:19:18.970 --> 00:19:21.830
<i>N-Nailed it!</i>

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:27.640
<i>I coincidentally found out at 
work that Miyamo is into BL!</i>

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:29.770
<i>Ever since then, I've been 
playing those games nonstop,</i>

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:32.280
<i>and watched a ton online for research!</i>

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:34.480
<i>You recognize this, don't you, Miyamo?</i>

00:19:35.700 --> 00:19:37.380
<i>I love you, Shouhei.</i>

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:43.660
<b>Masaomi: "I love you, Shouhei."</b>

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:39.080
Th-This is it!

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:43.660
<i>The classic scene of the super famous 
BL game </i>Endor<i> known as the foot slam!</i>

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:46.620
So, apparently, Bloody Butterfly is just a...

00:19:43.860 --> 00:19:46.380
<i>I even got my subordinate 
to help me out with this.</i>

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:46.080
Welcome!

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:47.190
Huh?

00:19:47.190 --> 00:19:48.910
You're the only one I can ask!

00:19:49.320 --> 00:19:51.540
I-If it's for you, Andou-san...

00:19:51.830 --> 00:19:53.750
I-I'm really going to do this.

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:55.960
Yeah! Put all your weight on me!

00:19:59.730 --> 00:20:02.430
<i>It'll be fine... If I can get through this...</i>

00:20:03.210 --> 00:20:05.820
Hey! That's the foot slam from <i>Endor</i>!

00:20:05.820 --> 00:20:09.810
You know so much about BL, 
Andou-san! Let's talk!

00:20:07.880 --> 00:20:09.810
<i>Her smile...</i>

00:20:16.870 --> 00:20:17.610
<i>Huh?</i>

00:20:17.780 --> 00:20:21.010
<i>Miyamo? Please realize what this is... Quick!</i>

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:24.410
Manana, what's going on over there?

00:20:26.430 --> 00:20:27.710
Let me introduce you...

00:20:27.710 --> 00:20:29.670
This is my boyfriend.

00:20:30.070 --> 00:20:33.560
We're so in love that I don't 
care who sees. Got that?

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:36.250
PS... My body is super flexible.

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:37.820
Right?!

00:20:37.820 --> 00:20:39.920
<i>Actually, yeah, that's all this looks like...</i>

00:20:40.230 --> 00:20:42.040
Well, we shouldn't interrupt.

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:43.590
We'll just be going.

00:20:43.910 --> 00:20:45.050
H-Huh?!

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:47.370
Hey! That's from <i>Endor</i>!

00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:53.750
Man, what a sight to see
first thing in the morning...

00:20:53.750 --> 00:20:55.380
I guess we were just headed the same way

00:20:55.380 --> 00:20:57.400
because he was going to see his boyfriend...

00:20:59.640 --> 00:21:01.030
What's wrong, Chio-chan?

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:03.410
Well, I was just thinking...

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:07.100
I said that Andou-san might like me...

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:10.660
and now I'm really embarrassed...

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:15.490
Ugh! It's not like anyone would 
ever fall for someone like me!

00:21:15.490 --> 00:21:17.540
What? That's not true...

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:19.880
It is! No one would fall for me!

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:21.380
Ugh, I'm so embarrassed!

00:21:22.030 --> 00:21:24.210
That's not true.

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:26.470
Damn it!

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:29.760
It was going so well, but it somehow failed!

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:33.020
Sorry to drag you into this and 
make you do something so weird...

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:33.930
It's okay...

00:21:34.360 --> 00:21:37.100
I didn't even mind...

00:21:39.300 --> 00:21:42.070
<i>Chio's School Road</i>... Bam!

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:42.070
<b>Chio's</b>

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:42.070
School Road

00:21:42.220 --> 00:21:45.220
I managed to get Miyamo's email address.

00:21:45.600 --> 00:21:47.950
Today's the day I ask her on a date!

00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:53.120
Cancel | New Message
To: Miyamo
Subject: This might seem sudden
It's hot today. I think ice cream would taste
really good on a day like this.
That farm-fresh kind is really good.

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:50.870
Not too direct, but not too distant...

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:53.120
I-I have no idea what that 
means, but maybe this works...

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:57.790
Received message
From: Miyamo
To: Me
Subject: If you consider cost and value, you're actually better off
if you chomp on some juice you chilled in the freezer.

00:21:53.550 --> 00:21:54.710
<i>If you consider cost and value,</i>

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:57.790
<i>you're actually better off if you chomp 
on some juice you chilled in the freezer.</i>

00:21:57.790 --> 00:21:59.960
I got rejected!

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:39.980
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:30.350 --> 00:23:32.080
Next time on <i>Chio's School Road</i>,

00:23:32.080 --> 00:23:34.010
"Shinozuka-san, Sugar Content, 
and the Press Conference,"

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:36.990
"Thousand Spring," and "Andou and George."

00:23:36.990 --> 00:23:37.900
Look forward to it!

00:23:37.900 --> 00:23:39.980
Currently (toubun), sugar content 
